. Step 1: Read the data
skip 25
read calibrationline.dat x y
skip 0
set write decimals 5
.
. Step 2: Perform the fit
.
fit y x
.
. Step 3: Extract relevant quantitites
.
let resvar = ressd**2
.
let y0 = sequence 0 .25 12
feedback off
capture screen on
capture mpc3673.out
linear calibration y x y0
end of capture
.
